1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,910
Okay our first unspoken rule is about eating out.
好，我们的第一条不成文规则和外出吃饭有关。

2
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:17,161
You have to be assertive if you want to get service in a spanish tapas bar or restaurant.
如果想在西班牙小吃吧或餐厅获得服务，你得主动明确地表达需求。

3
00:00:17,161 --> 00:00:21,120
You know in some cultures people are used to the weight staff being really attentive.
你知道，有些文化里的人习惯服务人员特别殷勤。

4
00:00:21,120 --> 00:00:28,521
You know asking if they need another drink a top up more food or even kicking them out of the restaurant you know once they've paid their bill.
比如会问客人要不要再来一杯、添一点或再点些吃的，甚至客人付完账就把人请走。

5
00:00:28,521 --> 00:00:34,001
But here in spain it's much more hands off so that means you have to be assertive about your needs.
但按讲者的说法，西班牙这里的服务更少主动介入，所以你要主动说明自己的需求。

6
00:00:34,001 --> 00:00:39,801
So if you want to get a drink if you want to get the menu or if you want to get the bild you really have to ask for it.
所以无论你想要饮料、菜单，还是字幕写作 bild 的账单，都真的得主动要。

7
00:00:39,801 --> 00:00:55,360
You have to kind of chase that waiter down finally I have my photo on a wall in a spanish restaurant or bar in katon.
你得有点追着服务员问。终于，我的照片挂在一家西班牙餐厅或酒吧的墙上了，字幕地点写作 katon。

8
00:00:55,360 --> 00:01:02,881
So whether you're standing at the bar or sitting if you want to get the waiter attention just put your hand up catch their eye and say something like dise or now.
无论站在吧台还是坐着，想引起服务员注意，就举起手，和对方对上目光，再说类似字幕 dise or now 的话。

9
00:01:02,881 --> 00:01:09,441
And they might not come straight away because often waiters in spain have a lot more tables to take care of than you might be used to back home.
他们可能不会马上过来，因为讲者说，这里的服务员常常要照看的桌数比你在家乡习惯的更多。

10
00:01:09,441 --> 00:01:14,871
But you know if they forget or if they don't come in the next few minutes just gently the sc just ask them again.
如果他们忘了，或几分钟后还没来，就轻轻地再问一次。字幕中间有不清楚的 the sc。

11
00:01:14,881 --> 00:01:20,161
Be be polite but be assertive and remember generally they're not going to bring the bill unless you ask for it.
要有礼貌，但要明确主动。记住，按讲者经验，一般要你开口，他们才会拿账单过来。

12
00:01:20,161 --> 00:01:30,431
And until you ask for it you know here they're not as focused on turning tables so it's not like the minute you finish eating they're going to put the bill down and kick you out.
你不开口时，他们没那么注重翻台，所以不会像你刚吃完就把账单放下、催你离开。

13
00:01:30,441 --> 00:01:47,361
Okay one of my favorite dishes in all of spain it's like a vinegary slap across the face.
这是我最喜欢的西班牙菜之一，像一记醋味的巴掌拍在脸上。

14
00:01:47,361 --> 00:01:54,080
Okay so you finished your meal youve fought for the bill and you're wondering if you have to leave a tip and if so how much.
好，你吃完饭，好不容易要到账单，正在想要不要给小费，如果给，又该给多少。

15
00:01:54,080 --> 00:01:59,401
Well let's get one thing clear waiters in spain are paid or should be paid a living wage.
先说清楚，讲者认为西班牙服务员拿着，或者至少应该拿着，足以维持生活的工资。

16
00:01:59,401 --> 00:02:17,001
So there's no obligation ever to tip it's up to the diner at the diner's discretion if the food and the service was good.
所以他说并非一定要给小费，是否给由用餐者决定，视食物和服务是否满意而定。

17
00:02:17,001 --> 00:02:23,720
However warning I have seen reports of some restaurants in tourist departs of spain that are putting suggested tips on the bill.
不过提醒一下，我看到一些报道，说西班牙游客区有餐厅会把建议小费印到账单上。

18
00:02:23,720 --> 00:02:33,241
Literally on the bill it has a 0 tip if you want to leave 0 and it has a sad face and then next to a 10 suggested tip it has a happy face.
账单上如果选零小费，就配一张难过的脸；旁边建议给百分之十，又配一张笑脸。

19
00:02:33,241 --> 00:02:52,201
Now that is not normal and it means effectively you're in a tourist trap.
讲者认为这不正常，实际上说明你进了一家专门坑游客的店。

20
00:02:52,201 --> 00:02:57,880
But you might be wondering if you're paying with a credit card or debit card can you leave a tip if you haven't got change on you.
不过你也许会想，如果刷信用卡或借记卡，而身上没有零钱，能不能给小费呢？

21
00:02:57,880 --> 00:03:00,591
Can you add that tip onto your bill and yes you can.
能把小费加到账单里吗？讲者说可以。

22
00:03:00,601 --> 00:03:09,321
So sa the bill was you know 48 you might just say charge me 50 and I'll charge 50 on your card and ideally that extra 2 goes to the waiter.
比如账单是四十八，你可以说收我五十，对方就会在卡上刷五十，理想情况下多出的两元给服务员。

23
00:03:09,321 --> 00:03:17,761
Oh and these days you can ask for your food to take away a doggy bag just say.
哦，现在也可以请人把食物打包带走，也就是 doggy bag，只要说……
